5076:			    PS IS legal nothing changes: it stays admitted and
5077:			    unimplemented, still recorded by #279's latch, because
5078:			    float_emul.c models no PS arithmetic.
5079:			    instr(reserved), NOT goto bad -- the latter is a host-side
5080:			    emulation abort (cpu->running = 0), the confusion #236 and
5081:			    #237 already had to undo. Kept out of the fall-through
5082:			    group below on purpose: after it, DMFC/DMTC/L would land in
